# PRD #1287 C1 — runtime artifacts of the M4 conformance subsystem; none are committed.
#   *.log / gate-log.*  : local gate/self-validation logs.
#   .codex-cache/       : the gitignored rootless test-cache prefix the provisioner
#                         installs into on a Linux host WITHOUT the image-baked package
